repository-code: "https://github.com/Dhruv0747/ATLAS"
url: "https://github.com/Dhruv0747/ATLAS"
abstract: >-
  Project ATLAS is a four-wheel autonomous service rover built on ROS 2 Humble,
  Ubuntu 22.04, and the NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano Super. The project integrates
  LiDAR SLAM, Nav2 navigation, encoder and IMU state estimation, deterministic
  recovery, AI vision, voice interaction, safety arbitration, Foxglove, and
  wireless operator dashboards.
keywords:
  - autonomous rover
  - ROS 2 Humble
  - NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano
  - Nav2
  - SLAM
  - LiDAR
